outes for speedruns.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795640/extras/36d62c431f43282afb035d9607975c9a.poster.avif?t=1640073702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795640/extras/36d62c431f43282afb035d9607975c9a.webm?t=1640073702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795640/extras/36d62c431f43282afb035d9607975c9a.mp4?t=1640073702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE TO DIE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No checkpoints, no easy mode, no excuses. A hero's journey is never that simple.</li><li>Master each level to the point where you know every shot, wall run, and leap of faith like the back of your hand. Then, impress your friends with perfect runs!</li><li>Do what it takes to BLOW UP THE SUN!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795640/extras/81b82b5e2b8d7a715156df9d0f61101c.poster.avif?t=1640073702\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795640/extras/81b82b5e2b8d7a715156df9d0f61101c.webm?t=1640073702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795640/extras/81b82b5e2b8d7a715156df9d0f61101c.mp4?t=1640073702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "You have one job: BLOW UP THE SUN. A game perfect for parkour/shooter fans, speedrunners, and those looking for an extra challenging experience!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1